# Named bundles — <bundle-name>|<comma-separated module names>
#
# Pure sugar over repeated `wb add` calls (ARCHITECTURE.md principle 4,
# §10) — `wb install --bundle workstation` is exactly equivalent to one
# `wb add` call per listed name, nothing more. Empty of resolvable members
# until the modules.list catalog in this same directory is populated
# (Wave C); mirrors the three `dotfiles` profiles for continuity.
#
# Example (uncomment once the referenced modules exist in modules.list):
# workstation|git,gpg,ssh,shell
# server|git,ssh,shell
# minimal|git,ssh
